:{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1966786315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":152,"original_line":152,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1966663851,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":48,"position":48,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1975589389","pull_request_review_id":2651059487,"id":1975589389,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc51wRoN","diff_hunk":"@@ -133,6 +147,11 @@ lsp::TextDocumentItem GDScriptTextDocument::load_document_item(const Variant &p_\n \treturn doc;\n }\n \n+bool GDScriptTextDocument::is_valid_gd_file(const lsp::TextDocumentItem &p_doc) {\n+\t// LanguageId isn't always set, but check it for good practice\n+\treturn p_doc.languageId == \"gdscript\" || p_doc.uri.ends_with(\".gd\");","path":"modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_text_document.cpp","commit_id":"ba30adfa023ad3c7dac487f956bf4ce9ef55b4cd","original_commit_id":"ba30adfa023ad3c7dac487f956bf4ce9ef55b4cd","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I don't think checking the file extension on our side is a good idea. Editors like vscode allow changing the language mode for documents and with this PR, this will not work anymore (it receives initial diagnostics, but they never get updated). This might become a problem with custom tooling (e.g. preprocessor script which uses custom extensions). Also it might become a roadblock for implementing language embeddings (not sure if VSCode has such a capability, but for Idea IDE's a plugin could embed GDScript blocks into scene files for builtin scripts).\r\n\r\nInterpretation of the content type should be up to the editor IMO, so we should only be using the language id. As pointed out this is not sent with every request, but that is intended, since LSP is not stateless. When we receive a text document identifier we should already have received a text document item for the uri which contains this information.\r\n\r\n(Well that's the case for most notifications, sadly `didSave` seems under specified in this regard. I opened [an issue](https://github.com/microsoft/language-server-protocol/issues/2110) against the specification to clear this up.)\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-02-28T15:21:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T15:28:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103186#discussion_r1975589389","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103186","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1975589389"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103186#discussion_r1975589389"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103186"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1975589389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":152,"original_line":152,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1966663851,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":48,"position":48,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1985330888","pull_request_review_id":2667724185,"id":1985330888,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc52Vb7I","diff_hunk":"@@ -133,6 +147,11 @@ lsp::TextDocumentItem GDScriptTextDocument::load_document_item(const Variant &p_\n \treturn doc;\n }\n \n+bool GDScriptTextDocument::is_valid_gd_file(const lsp::TextDocumentItem &p_doc) {\n+\t// LanguageId isn't always set, but check it for good practice\n+\treturn p_doc.languageId == \"gdscript\" || p_doc.uri.ends_with(\".gd\");","path":"modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_text_document.cpp","commit_id":"ba30adfa023ad3c7dac487f956bf4ce9ef55b4cd","original_commit_id":"ba30adfa023ad3c7dac487f956bf4ce9ef55b4cd","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Based on the answer to the issue over at the LSP repo, I think we can work under the assumption that `didSave` requires taking ownership. So the correct approach would be to save the content type the editor provides with `didOpen` and then use it for other notifications.","created_at":"2025-03-07T16:07:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T16:07:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103186#discussion_r1985330888","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103186","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1985330888"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103186#discussion_r1985330888"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103186"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1985330888/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":152,"original_line":152,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1966663851,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":48,"position":48,"subject_type":"line"}]